  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I samarbete mellan UD och Sida f&#xf6;rsl&#xe5;s att ett avslutningsevenemang  f&#xf6;r #firstgeneration-kampanjen arrangeras i h&#xf6;st, d&#xe4;r det svenska engagemanget kopplas samman med    det internationella. Evenemanget ber&#xe4;knas ha 300 deltagare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In cooperation between the MFA and Sida we held a closing event for the campaign #firstgeneration held in the autumn, where the Swedish involvement linked to the international. The event is estimated to have 300 participants.</narrative>
